---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<Layout title="About BLK | Bully Legion KaapStad" description="The principles behind Bully Legion KaapStad.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Cape Town, South Africa" title="A legacy with receipts." copy="BLK is a Cape Town American Bully programme with a simple premise: pedigree matters, but welfare and accountability matter more." />
  <section class="principles container">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">What guides us</p><h2 class="display">The work<br />behind the name.</h2></div>
    <div class="principle-list"><article><span>01</span><h3>Welfare first</h3><p>Dogs are not products. Every decision starts with their health, stability, and quality of life.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Honest records</h3><p>Health testing, pedigree context, and real care information should be clear, not buried in a caption.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Prepared homes</h3><p>Good outcomes depend on fit, education, and support long after a dog joins its new family.</p></article></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .principles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr; gap: 5rem; padding: 6rem 0 7rem; } h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem); } .principle-list { border-top: 1px solid #c5bcae; } article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr 1.25fr; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #c5bcae; } article span { color: var(--bronze); font-weight: 700; } h3 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1; } article p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); } @media (max-width: 700px) { .principles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; padding: 4rem 0; } article { grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr; } article p { grid-column: 2; } }
</style>